    ],
    "text": "I hereby given notice, Sub-section 7 of the Land AcquisitionAct, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act,No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire thefollowing land/ servitude which is required for a publicpurpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
