      540.72,
      309.84,
      610.79
    ],
    "text": "Portions of land described in the schedule attached,situated in the Uda ellegama village in the SoranathotaDivisional Secretary's Division in Badulla District, in theprovince of Uva, containing about 0.6359 hectares in extentand depicted in the supplement No. 40 of the village Plan No.88, prepared by the surveyor General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
