      434.88,
      561.92,
      552.95
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which aservitude is to be acquired to appear personally or by agentsduly authorized in writing , before me at Soranathota DivisionalSecretary's Office on the 16th day of August 2017 at 2.00 p.m.and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate)on or befor the 07th day of August 2017 the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitudethe amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
